<title>SPAIN: Spain says only Iberia hit by Latam deals.</title>
<headline>Spain says only Iberia hit by Latam deals.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Industry Minister Josep Pique said on Thursday Iberia had had a bad experience in Latin America, but that it was the exception as other Spanish companies had benefited from investments in the continent.</p>
<p>&quot;Iberia's strategic decision (to enter Latin America) was good but the conditions of the deal were probably bad and the management probably had debatable aspects,&quot; Pique told state radio.</p>
<p>&quot;I would say that this is the only bad experience that Spanish companies have had in Latin America,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
